    {"id":"SC04-S02","pieces":[["Hello! I'm sorry","你好！很抱歉，"],["but I can't talk at the moment.","我现在没法聊。"],["I need to go home now.","我得回家了。"],["Can we talk tomorrow?","我们明天聊好吗？"]]},
