    {"id":"SC05-S01","pieces":[["Good evening, Sarah.","晚上好，Sarah。"],["Did you have a long day?","你今天忙了一整天吗？"]]},
    {"id":"SC05-S02","pieces":[["Yes, very.","是的，非常忙。"],["I'm very tired now.","我现在很累了。"],["Good night. See you tomorrow.","晚安。明天见。"]]},
    {"id": "SC06-S01", "pieces": [["Excuse me. Hello.", "打扰一下。你好。"], ["What's your name?", "你叫什么名字？"]]},
    {"id": "SC06-S02", "whole": "short, right size"},
    {"id": "SC06-S03", "whole": "short, right size"},
    {"id": "SC06-S04", "pieces": [["Pleased to meet you too.", "我也很高兴认识你。"], ["Where are you from?", "你是哪里人？"]]},
    {"id": "SC06-S05", "pieces": [["I'm from Manchester,", "我来自 Manchester，"], ["but I live in London now.", "不过我现在住在 London。"], ["And you?", "你呢？"]]},
    {"id": "SC06-S06", "pieces": [["I'm from France.", "我来自法国。"], ["I've been here for two years.", "我在这里已经两年了。"]]},
    {"id": "SC06-S07", "pieces": [["This is a lovely city.", "这是一座很可爱的城市。"], ["What do you do?", "你是做什么工作的？"]]},
    {"id": "SC06-S08", "pieces": [["I'm a nurse,", "我是护士，"], ["at the hospital just round the corner.", "就在拐角那家医院工作。"], ["And you?", "你呢？"]]},
    {"id": "SC06-S09", "pieces": [["I'm sorry, I didn't understand you.", "对不起，我没有听懂你的话。"], ["I'm learning English.", "我在学习英语。"], ["Could you say that again more slowly?", "你能再慢一点儿说一遍吗？"]]},
    {"id": "SC06-S10", "pieces": [["Yes, of course.", "好的，当然可以。"], ["I'm a nurse.", "我是护士。"], ["I work at the hospital.", "我在医院工作。"], ["It's near here.", "就在这附近。"], ["And what do you do?", "那你是做什么的呢？"]]},
    {"id": "SC06-S11", "pieces": [["I teach English,", "我教英语，"], ["but not in a school.", "不过不是在学校教。"], ["I work with adults.", "我教成年人。"], ["I'm on holiday here with my wife and children.", "我和妻子、孩子在这里度假。"], ["We're having a lovely time.", "我们玩得很开心。"]]},
    {"id": "SC06-S12", "pieces": [["How interesting.", "真有意思。"], ["Well, lovely to meet you.", "那么，很高兴认识你。"]]},
