    {"id": "SC07-S04", "pieces": [["I'd like large, please.", "我想要大杯，麻烦您。"], ["With oat milk if you have it.", "如果有燕麦奶的话，就加燕麦奶。"]]},
    {"id": "SC07-S05", "pieces": [["Of course.", "当然可以。"], ["Would you like to sit-in or takeaway?", "您要堂食还是打包带走？"]]},
