    {"id": "SC08-S02", "pieces": [["I'd like a pint, please.", "麻烦您，我想要一品脱。"], ["What ales do you have on?", "您这儿有哪些麦芽啤酒？"]]},
    {"id": "SC08-S03", "pieces": [["We've got a bitter and a stout,", "我们有一款苦啤酒和一款黑啤酒，"], ["and they're both local.", "两款都是本地的。"]]},
    {"id": "SC08-S04", "whole": "one request, right size"},
    {"id": "SC08-S05", "whole": "one request, right size"},
    {"id": "SC08-S06", "pieces": [["Could I see the wine list?", "我可以看看酒单吗？"], ["I want a glass of wine.", "我想要一杯葡萄酒。"]]},
    {"id": "SC08-S07", "pieces": [["We have a house red, a house white,", "我们有招牌红葡萄酒、招牌白葡萄酒，"], ["or you could have one of our bottles.", "您也可以选一瓶我们的瓶装酒。"]]},
