    {"id": "SC08-S12", "pieces": [["I'm not sure if I'm hungry.", "我不确定我饿不饿。"], ["Do you have a menu?", "您这儿有菜单吗？"]]},
    {"id": "SC08-S13", "pieces": [["Yes, of course. Here it is.", "有的，当然有。给您。"], ["The fish and chips are very good.", "我们的炸鱼薯条非常好吃。"]]},
    {"id": "SC08-S14", "pieces": [["Can we have some bread?", "我们可以要一些面包吗？"], ["And a bowl of chips for the table.", "再来一碗薯条放在桌上一起吃。"]]},
    {"id": "SC08-S15", "pieces": [["Do you have any sandwiches?", "您这儿有三明治吗？"], ["I'd like a cheese sandwich, please.", "麻烦您，我想要一个奶酪三明治。"]]},
    {"id": "SC08-S16", "whole": "narrator numbers and colours"},
    {"id": "SC09-S01", "pieces": [["Good evening.", "晚上好。"], ["We have a booking for two,", "我们有一个两人的预订，"], ["under the name Davies.", "用 Davies 这个名字订的。"]]},
    {"id":"SC09-S02","pieces":[["Welcome.","欢迎光临。"],["Please follow me.","请跟我来。"],["Here are the menus.","这是菜单。"]]},
    {"id": "SC09-S03", "whole": "one question, right size"},
    {"id": "SC09-S04", "whole": "please opens the Chinese and closes the English, so no cut pairs both sides"},
    {"id": "SC09-S05", "pieces": [["Excuse me — do you have anything gluten-free?", "打扰一下——您这儿有无麸质的菜吗？"], ["Or for vegetarians?", "或者适合素食者的菜？"]]},
    {"id": "SC09-S06", "pieces": [["Yes, the salmon and the risotto are both gluten-free.", "有的，三文鱼和烩饭都是无麸质的。"], ["We also have some salads.", "我们还有一些沙拉。"]]},
    {"id": "SC09-S07", "whole": "one question, right size"},
    {"id": "SC09-S08", "pieces": [["The lamb is excellent.", "羊肉非常好。"], ["It's been slow-cooked, with rosemary.", "是用迷迭香慢炖的。"]]},
    {"id": "SC09-S09", "pieces": [["I'll have the lamb, please.", "那我要羊肉，麻烦您。"], ["With a side of greens.", "再配一份青菜。"]]},
    {"id": "SC09-S10", "pieces": [["And the risotto for me.", "我要烩饭。"], ["With a small green salad to start.", "先来一份小份的青菜沙拉。"]]},
    {"id": "SC09-S11", "pieces": [["Of course.", "好的。"], ["And what would you like to drink?", "那您们想喝点什么？"]]},
    {"id": "SC09-S12", "whole": "one question, right size"},
    {"id": "SC09-S13", "whole": "one statement, right size"},
    {"id": "SC09-S14", "pieces": [["Excellent choice.", "很好的选择。"], ["I'll bring it right over.", "我马上给您拿来。"]]},
    {"id": "SC09-S15", "pieces": [["Is everything alright?", "一切都还好吗？"], ["Do you have any room for dessert?", "您们还有空间吃点甜点吗？"]]},
    {"id": "SC09-S16", "pieces": [["Just two coffees, please.", "只要两杯咖啡，谢谢。"], ["Decaf for me.", "我的要不含咖啡因的。"]]},
    {"id": "SC09-S17", "pieces": [["And the bill, when you're ready.", "还有账单，等您方便的时候。"], ["Could we split it?", "我们可以分开付吗？"]]},
    {"id": "SC09-S18", "whole": "narrator numbers and colours"},
    {"id": "SC10-S01", "pieces": [["Excuse me.", "打扰一下。"], ["Do you have any painkillers?", "您们有止痛药吗？"]]},
    {"id": "SC10-S02", "whole": "one statement, right size"},
    {"id": "SC10-S03", "pieces": [["Thank you.", "谢谢。"], ["And do you have any painkillers for children?", "您这儿有给儿童用的止痛药吗？"]]},
    {"id": "SC10-S04", "pieces": [["I think so,", "我想是有的，"], ["but you'll have to look to make sure.", "不过您得自己看一下才能确定。"]]},
    {"id":"SC10-S05","pieces":[["I also need to get","我还需要买"],["some sunscreen","一些防晒霜"],["and some toothpaste.","和一些牙膏。"]]},
    {"id": "SC10-S06", "pieces": [["Sunscreen is down there on your right,", "防晒霜在那边，您的右手边，"], ["and you'll find toothpaste just round the corner.", "牙膏就在拐角那里。"]]},
    {"id": "SC10-S07", "pieces": [["Thank you, you've been very helpful.", "谢谢，您帮了我大忙。"], ["I'm very grateful.", "我非常感激。"]]},
    {"id": "SC10-S08", "pieces": [["You're welcome.", "不客气。"], ["Are you here on holiday?", "您是来度假的吗？"], ["You speak very good English.", "您的英语说得非常好。"]]},
    {"id": "SC10-S09", "pieces": [["That's very kind of you!", "您太客气了！"], ["Yes, I'm on holiday,", "是的，我在度假，"], ["and I need to practice more", "我需要多练习，"], ["to speak English better.", "才能把英语说得更好。"], ["Thank you very much, and goodbye.", "非常感谢，再见。"]]},
